rt of radical change... is preceded by a change in individual philosophy.'", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "val:community_infrastructure", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:scoville", "note": "'My value for the community is what persuaded me to study energy systems.'", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "val:energy_justice_val", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:fie2020", "note": "Title and thesis of the paper.", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "val:pragmatism", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:cw_meaning", "note": "Camus preferred to Nietzsche on grounds of workability.", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "thy:energy_justice", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:fie2020", "note": "Title construct of the paper.", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "ctb:proactive_regulation", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:scoville", "note": "Policy essay: 'Technology will advance with or without legislation.'", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "prn:individual_in_institutions", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:cw_institutions", "note": "Thesis of the 2015 paper.", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "prn:pragmatic_agency", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:cw_meaning", "note": "Camus preferred to Nietzsche.", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "prn:community_as_security", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:scoville", "note": "Opening paragraph of the personal statement.", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "prn:teach_adaptation", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:more_statement", "note": "Direct quotation.", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "prn:self_contained_solution", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:scoville", "note": "On why SolarSPELL worked.", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "prn:facilitated_action", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:eagle_essay", "note": "Closing paragraph.", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "person:darshan_karwat", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:fie2020", "note": "Co-author.", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "person:wendy_barnard", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:asee2021", "note": "Co-author.", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "person:adam_carberry", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:asee2021", "note": "Co-author, per the 2024 resume publication list.", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "pub:ieee_cogdev", "predicate": "serves_audience", "target": "aud:engineering_educators", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "pub:ieee_cogdev", "predicate": "addresses_problem", "target": "prob:unprepared_for_novelty", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "pub:ieee_cogdev", "predicate": "uses_process", "target": "proc:qual_inquiry", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "pub:ieee_cogdev", "predicate": "sited_at", "target": "place:project_based_program", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "pub:ieee_cogdev", "predicate": "serves_purpose", "target": "purp:adapt_not_obsolete", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "pub:ieee_toe", "predicate": "serves_audience", "target": "aud:engineering_educators", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "pub:ieee_toe", "predicate": "addresses_problem", "target": "prob:unmeasurable_outcomes", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "pub:ieee_toe", "predicate": "uses_process", "target": "proc:scaffolded_self_direction", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "pub:ieee_toe", "predicate": "sited_at", "target": "place:project_based_program", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "pub:ieee_toe", "predicate": "serves_purpose", "target": "purp:adapt_not_obsolete", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "pub:asee2016", "predicate": "serves_audience", "target": "aud:young_makers", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "pub:asee2016", "predicate": "uses_process", "target": "proc:qual_inquiry", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "pub:asee2017", "predicate": "serves_audience", "target": "aud:young_makers", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "pub:asee2017", "predicate": "uses_process", "target": "proc:iterative_prototyping", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "pub:asee2017", "predicate": "addresses_problem", "target": "prob:unprepared_for_novelty", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "prn:workforce_transition", "predicate": "serves_audience", "target": "aud:engineers_in_transition", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "prn:workforce_transition", "predicate": "addresses_problem", "target": "prob:obsolescence", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "prn:workforce_transition", "predicate": "sited_at", "target": "place:energy_sector", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "prn:workforce_transition", "predicate": "serves_purpose", "target": "purp:adapt_not_obsolete", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "skill:theory_building", "predicate": "addresses_problem", "target": "prob:experience_not_legible", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "proc:framework_from_evidence", "predicate": "addresses_problem", "target": "prob:experience_not_legible", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "skill:alt_energy", "predicate": "sited_at", "target": "place:energy_sector", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "skill:alt_energy", "predicate": "composes_niche", "target": "niche:energy_workforce", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "skill:instructional_design", "predicate": "composes_niche", "target": "niche:energy_workforce", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "skill:curriculum_analysis", "predicate": "composes_niche", "target": "niche:energy_workforce", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "skill:theory_building", "predicate": "composes_niche", "target": "niche:energy_workforce", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "skill:embedded_systems", "predicate": "composes_niche", "target": "niche:energy_workforce", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "skill:qual_research", "predicate": "composes_niche", "target": "niche:learning_research", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "skill:academic_writing", "predicate": "composes_niche", "target": "niche:learning_research", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "skill:coding_analysis", "predicate": "composes_niche", "target": "niche:learning_research", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "skill:interviewing", "predicate": "composes_niche", "target": "niche:learning_research", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "skill:theory_building", "predicate": "composes_niche", "target": "niche:learning_research", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "person:james_larson", "predicate": "motivated_by", "target": "mot:understanding_how_people_learn", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "person:james_larson", "predicate": "motivated_by", "target": "mot:building_frameworks", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "person:james_larson", "predicate": "motivated_by", "target": "mot:keeping_people_employable", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "skill:qual_research", "predicate": "transfers_to", "target": "aud:engineers_in_transition", "note": "The interview craft built for students is needs-analysis craft for a workforce programme.", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "thy:adaptive_expertise", "predicate": "transfers_to", "target": "aud:engineers_in_transition", "note": "The theory was developed on students facing novel problems. Engineers facing new technologies are the same problem at a later age, and nobody has connected them yet.", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "ctb:activation_energy", "predicate": "transfers_to", "target": "prob:obsolescence", "note": "Retraining fails when the activation energy of asking for help exceeds the cost of coping. That is a workforce finding stated as an education one.", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "skill:curriculum_analysis", "predicate": "transfers_to", "target": "aud:learning_orgs", "note": "Analysing a learning ecology transfers to onboarding and enablement design.", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "ctb:ecology_roles", "predicate": "transfers_to", "target": "aud:engineers_in_transition", "note": "Facilitator, near-peer and client roles exist on a shop floor as much as in a household.", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "theme:self_direction", "predicate": "recurs_as", "target": "val:self_direction", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "theme:self_direction", "predicate": "recurs_as", "target": "thy:sdl", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "theme:self_direction", "predicate": "recurs_as", "target": "ctb:maker_family_values", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "theme:self_direction", "predicate": "recurs_as", "target": "prn:workforce_transition", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "theme:naming_gaps", "predicate": "recurs_as", "target": "val:naming_things", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "theme:naming_gaps", "predicate": "recurs_as", "target": "ctb:activation_energy", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "theme:naming_gaps", "predicate": "recurs_as", "target": "ctb:nonsequential_development", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "theme:naming_gaps", "predicate": "recurs_as", "target": "ctb:maker_family_values", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "theme:ecology_not_instruction", "predicate": "recurs_as", "target": "thy:learning_ecology", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "theme:ecology_not_instruction", "predicate": "recurs_as", "target": "ctb:activation_energy", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "theme:ecology_not_instruction", "predicate": "recurs_as", "target": "ctb:ecology_roles", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "theme:two_unjoined_halves", "predicate": "recurs_as", "target": "skill:alt_energy", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "theme:two_unjoined_halves", "predicate": "recurs_as", "target": "thy:adaptive_expertise", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "theme:two_unjoined_halves", "predicate": "recurs_as", "target": "prn:workforce_transition", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "theme:two_unjoined_halves", "predicate": "recurs_as", "target": "niche:energy_workforce", "prov": "inferred"}, {"source": "pub:asee2021", "predicate": "grounded_in", "target": "thy:eop", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "pub:asee2021", "predicate": "applies_method", "target": "meth:mixed_methods", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "pub:fie2020", "predicate": "grounded_in", "target": "thy:technoethics", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "pub:fie2020", "predicate": "grounded_in", "target": "thy:trl", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "pub:fie2020", "predicate": "grounded_in", "target": "thy:winner_artifacts", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "artifact:shuttle_report", "predicate": "applies_method", "target": "meth:techno_economic", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "ev:mlp_research_design", "predicate": "grounded_in", "target": "thy:geels_mlp", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "thy:geels_mlp", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:cw_transitions", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "thy:technoethics", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:cw_nuclear", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "thy:trl", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:cw_nuclear", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "thy:winner_artifacts", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:cw_nuclear", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "thy:eop", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:asee2021", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "person:nathan_johnson", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:cw_shuttle", "prov": "verified", "note": "Listed as Principal Investigator."}, {"source": "person:nathan_webster", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:cw_shuttle", "prov": "verified", "note": "Listed as Research Aide."}, {"source": "org:srp", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:cw_shuttle", "prov": "verified", "note": "Named funder of the Polytechnic Solar Utilization project."}, {"source": "skill:techno_economic", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:cw_shuttle", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "skill:survey_research", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:asee2021", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "meth:mixed_methods", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:asee2021", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "meth:techno_economic", "predicate": "documented_in", "target": "src:cw_shuttle", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "role:leaps_gra", "predicate": "produced", "target": "artifact:shuttle_report", "prov": "verified"}, {"source": "src:cw_nuclear", "predicate": "extends", "target": "pub:fie2020", "prov": "verified", "note": "The EGR 598 final project and the FIE 2020 paper share a title, a thesis and an author pair."}, {"source": "thy:geels_mlp", "predicate": "translates_to", "target": "thy:learning_ecology", "prov": "inferred", "note": "Geels' regime resisting a niche innovation and Barron's learning ecology are the same shape: a settled system of practices, resources and relationships that determines what a newcomer can actually do. He has spent a decade on this structure in two literatures that do not cite each other."}, {"source": "thy:adaptive_expertise", "predicate": "translates_to", "target": "thy:geels_mlp", "prov": "inferred", "note": "Adaptive expertise is the individual-scale version of transition theory. One asks how a person handles a situation they were not trained for; the other asks how a system absorbs a technology it was not built for."}, {"source": "thy:routine_expertise", "predicate": "contradicts", "target": "thy:adaptive_expertise", "prov": "verified", "note": "The field's core opposition and the axis the whole record sits on."}, {"source": "niche:learning_research", "predicate": "contradicts", "target": "niche:energy_workforce", "prov": "inferred", "note": "The actual career question. One niche is proven and you have left it; the other is stated and unproven. The graph cannot choose for you, but it can stop you pretending the tension is not there."}], "validation": {"ok": true, "problems": []}};
const byId = new Map(G.nodes.map(n=>[n.id,n]));
const label = id => (byId.get(id)||{}).label || id;
const NODE_COLS = [["id","ID"],["type","Type"],["label","Label"],["year","Year"],["prov","Prov"]];
const EDGE_COLS = [["source","Source"],["predicate","Predicate"],["target","Target"],["via","Via"]];
const rows = {
  nodes: G.nodes.map(n=>({id:n.id,type:n.type,label:n.label,year:n.year??"",prov:n.prov||""})),
  edges: G.edges.map(e=>({source:label(e.source),predicate:e.predicate,target:label(e.target),via:e.via||"",
                           _s:e.source,_t:e.target}))
};
let tab="nodes", sortKey=null, sortDir=1;
const thead=document.querySelector("#tbl thead"), tbody=document.querySelector("#tbl tbody");
function facetValues(){
  const key = tab==="nodes" ? "type" : "predicate";
  return [...new Set(rows[tab].map(r=>r[key]))].sort();
}
function buildFacet(){
  const sel=document.getElementById("facet");
  sel.innerHTML='<option value="">All '+(tab==="nodes"?"types":"predicates")+"</option>"+
    facetValues().map(v=>`<option>${v}</option>`).join("");
}
function render(){
  const cols = tab==="nodes" ? NODE_COLS : EDGE_COLS;
  const q = document.getElementById("q").value.toLowerCase();
  const f = document.getElementById("facet").value;
  const fkey = tab==="nodes" ? "type" : "predicate";
  let data = rows[tab].filter(r=>(!f||r[fkey]===f) &&
    (!q || Object.values(r).join(" ").toLowerCase().includes(q)));
  if(sortKey) data = [...data].sort((a,b)=> String(a[sortKey]).localeCompare(String(b[sortKey]),undefined,{numeric:true})*sortDir);
  thead.innerHTML = "<tr>"+cols.map(([k,lab])=>`<th data-k="${k}">${lab}${sortKey===k?(sortDir>0?" ▲":" ▼"):""}</th>`).join("")+"</tr>";
  tbody.innerHTML = data.map(r=>"<tr>"+cols.map(([k])=>{
    let v = r[k] ?? "";
    if(tab==="edges" && (k==="source"||k==="target")) v = `${v} <span class="id">${k==="source"?r._s:r._t}</span>`;
    return `<td class="${k==="id"?"mono":""}">${String(v).replace(/</g,"&lt;")}</td>`;
  }).join("")+"</tr>").join("");
  document.getElementById("count").textContent = `${data.length} of ${rows[tab].length} rows`;
  thead.querySelectorAll("th").forEach(th=>th.onclick=()=>{
    const k=th.dataset.k; if(sortKey===k) sortDir*=-1; else {sortKey=k; sortDir=1;} render();
  });
}
function setTab(t){ tab=t; sortKey=null;
  document.getElementById("tabNodes").classList.toggle("on",t==="nodes");
  document.getElementById("tabEdges").classList.toggle("on",t==="edges");
  buildFacet(); render(); }
document.getElementById("tabNodes").onclick=()=>setTab("nodes");
document.getElementById("tabEdges").onclick=()=>setTab("edges");
document.getElementById("q").oninput=render;
document.getElementById("facet").onchange=render;
document.getElementById("csv").onclick=()=>{
  const cols = tab==="nodes" ? NODE_COLS : EDGE_COLS;
  const q = document.getElementById("q").value.toLowerCase();
  const f = document.getElementById("facet").value, fkey = tab==="nodes" ? "type" : "predicate";
  const esc = v => `"${String(v??"").replace(/"/g,'""')}"`;
  const data = rows[tab].filter(r=>(!f||r[fkey]===f) && (!q || Object.values(r).join(" ").toLowerCase().includes(q)));
  const text = [cols.map(c=>c[1]).join(",")].concat(data.map(r=>cols.map(([k])=>esc(r[k])).join(","))).join("\n");
  const a=document.createElement("a");
  a.href=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([text],{type:"text/csv"}));
  a.download=`knowledge-graph-${tab}.csv`; a.click(); URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href);
};
setTab("nodes");
</script></body></html>
